    "memo": "<p><strong>Setup</strong>:</p><ul><li>Lay out all equipment and tools near the installation site.</li><li>Double-check the alignment of components with the work order.</li></ul><p><strong>Mounting Equipment</strong>:</p><ul><li>Install mounts for displays, projectors, or speakers as per manufacturer&#39;s specifications.</li><li>Ensure mounts are level and secure.</li></ul><p><strong>Cabling</strong>:</p><ul><li>Run cables through designated conduits or raceways.</li><li>Label cables at both ends for easy identification.</li><li>Test cable runs with a tester before connecting.</li></ul><p><strong>Connecting Devices</strong>:</p><ul><li>Connect displays, projectors, speakers, and other devices to the AV hub or control system.</li><li>Verify connections match the schematic provided.</li></ul><p><strong>Calibration</strong>:</p><ul><li>Configure settings on displays, projectors, and audio equipment for optimal performance.</li><li>Adjust audio levels and calibrate visuals to suit the room&#39;s acoustics and lighting.</li></ul>",
