      "memo": "<p>### **Furniture Installation and Drop-Off Work Requested: Sample Bullet Points**  </p><p></p><p>- **Delivery Coordination**:  </p><p>  - Schedule and confirm delivery date and time with the client.  </p><p>  - Ensure all furniture pieces are securely packed for transit.  </p><p></p><p>- **On-Site Furniture Drop-Off**:  </p><p>  - Deliver furniture to the specified location.  </p><p>  - Unload items carefully to avoid damages.  </p><p></p><p>- **Furniture Assembly and Installation**:  </p><p>  - Assemble all furniture pieces as per the manufacturer&#39;s instructions.  </p><p>  - Install or place furniture according to the client’s specifications.  </p><p>  - Ensure stability and safety of all assembled items.  </p><p></p><p>- **Site Clean-Up**:  </p><p>  - Remove and dispose of all packaging materials.  </p><p>  - Leave the site clean and tidy post-installation.  </p><p></p><p>- **Final Inspection and Client Sign-Off**:  </p><p>  - Conduct a walkthrough with the client to ensure satisfaction.  </p><p>  - Address any immediate concerns or adjustments as required.  </p>",
